# Substrate patch series for the Open POSIX Test Suite.
#
# None at present.  The build driver (build.sh) compiles each test
# individually and records the ones that fail to compile against
# substrate's headers/libs (missing POSIX symbols such as
# _SC_ASYNCHRONOUS_IO, SIGRTMIN, siginfo si_value, MQ_PRIO_MAX, and
# assorted pthread_* timed/barrier/spin APIs) as build failures rather
# than patching them away — a build failure on a missing interface is
# itself a legitimate conformance-baseline datapoint, and we deliberately
# do NOT hack substrate's libc/headers just to make a test compile.
